Malis's cousin lives in Australia. Every month, Malis writes a letter, puts it in an envelope and posts it in the postbox. Her cousin sends stamps for her stamp collection. They also have a video chat at the weekend. When her cousin was in hospital, she sent a message and made a phone call home. Now Malis has an invitation to visit her in Sydney!

